                                                "sense_id": "d505bc71-b609-36c3-9160-017bb66741bb",
                                                "text": "lmao everyone think i'm girlmoding nah bitch i just wear plain white shirts and skinny jeans, that's called lazymoding"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25edd40c-0591-4b8b-8bd6-6a331029591f",
                                                "sense_id": "d505bc71-b609-36c3-9160-017bb66741bb",
                                                "text": "I swear my mere presence, boymoding or girlmoding, has historically spread transness. Stumbled upon a friendship group I moved in when I was about 14 on twitter and half of them are trans now. I'm patient zero and nobody can tell me otherwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3f41650-b1ff-4566-a6e5-bc20a7e4f711",
                                                "sense_id": "d505bc71-b609-36c3-9160-017bb66741bb",
                                                "text": "My confidence has been doing a lot better since girlmoding more. I still need a lot more clothes, better makeup skills, and my eyebrows fixed for me to feel more comfortable but I’m trying at least."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bae06334-167a-4082-9bb0-85a832dfb668",
                                                "sense_id": "d505bc71-b609-36c3-9160-017bb66741bb",
                                                "text": "hi. recently quit a job that felt more like an abusive relationship. […] right and right again, i have had about an interview every two weeks for the last two months but to no avail- they all ghost. i use a feminine name and dont pass well due to my long hair and how i talk. i am starting to wonder if i am not hearing back from anyone (even the ones who promise a second interview, which has been three times now, have ghosted!) because i am clearly trans. would it be better to girlmode and come out later??"
                                            }
